      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/202607152350124953_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/202607152350124953_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/202607152350124953_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/match1867454date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连续两届进决赛！阿根廷2-1绝杀英格兰 劳塔罗恩佐破门梅西两助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260716/zhanbao_image_1867454_1784149063_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260716/zhanbao_image_1867454_1784149063_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260716/zhanbao_image_1867454_1784149063_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-1逆转英格兰，连续两届晋级世界杯决赛，将于7月20日凌晨3时迎战西班牙，英格兰将在季军赛对阵法国。</p><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57babf7a4d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧洲冠军vs美洲冠军！世界杯决赛：西班牙vs阿根廷！亚马尔PK梅西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f4ed18502.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f4ed18502.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f4ed18502.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯半决赛，阿根廷淘汰英格兰晋级决赛，他们将与淘汰法国的西班牙争夺本届冠军。巴萨两代10号对决，19岁的亚马尔将对阵39岁的梅西。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57d7eec7e42native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">从澡盆到世界杯决赛！19岁亚马尔PK39岁梅西，两代巴萨10号对决</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160327426461_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160327426461_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160327426461_1280.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨两代10号的首次直接对决，19岁亚马尔将面对39岁梅西。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57bc12755d7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩PK凯恩！季军赛：法国vs英格兰 上届英格兰8强赛遭法国淘汰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160231448537_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160231448537_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160231448537_720.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯季军赛对阵就此敲定：英格兰将与法国争夺赛事第三名。法国已于前一日的半决赛中落败，提前无缘决赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a56eb6ca72d2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">60年等待继续！不敌卫冕冠军，英格兰近3届世界杯第2次止步半决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160508119583_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160508119583_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160508119583_1280.jpg"> </div><p>自1966年首进决赛并成功夺冠后，英格兰对世界杯冠军的等待将继续。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57f36a397fdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">怎么吹？39岁梅西半决赛两助攻带队连进世界杯决赛，本届8球4助！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57cca973575_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57cca973575.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57cca973575.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯，梅西7场比赛贡献8个进球，4个助攻，淘汰赛已经连续3场比赛都有助攻进账。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a577c852ee82native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两次助攻帮助球队翻盘！官方：梅西当选阿根廷2-1英格兰全场最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a58008d21638.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a58008d21638.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a58008d21638.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-1逆转英格兰晋级决赛。梅西本场比赛送出两记助攻助队逆转。赛后，梅西被评选为官方本场比赛全场最佳球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57f66b823dbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击大赛四连冠！阿根廷晋级世界杯决赛，美洲杯+世界杯已3连冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f725a1dd1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f725a1dd1_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a57f725a1dd1_1280.jpg"> </div><p>在晋级决赛后，阿根廷将冲击大赛四连冠的成就。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57cc1ad207anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷进决赛之路：淘汰赛胜佛得角 埃及 瑞士，逆转英格兰进决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a531547de05a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a531547de05a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a531547de05a.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯半决赛，阿根廷淘汰英格兰，晋级决赛！来回顾本届阿根廷至今的历程。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a57c8c7194d0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯决赛双方多久没夺冠？西班牙16年前首冠 阿根廷上届刚夺冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221219/639fe261dab89.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_